      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, sorry—I think there's been a misunderstanding. I'm looking for advice for a professional corporate training module for managers, not a fantasy story. Can you please provide that same summary again, but keep it strictly professional and business-like? Please leave out the metaphors about forests and goblins so I can use the text directly in my presentation.",
